ople that  had different you know supposed  abilities to talk to the dead and so on  to find some way  if you could talk to her simply just one  last time right that's all he was really  looking for  and the guy dumped all his money into it  now most of the people that he came  across were frauds right people who  could supposedly talk to the dad and it  was just reading tarot cards and then  interpreting the tarot cards in a way  that he would he might  appreciate basically cold readers is  really all they were until he came  across  a legitimate mystic right like a woman  who could quite literally commune with  his wife and while that was possible  he ended up learning that his wife  actually died with an unborn child  and so getting what it was that he  wanted he wasn't able to pay her  and so this basically led to her cursing  him as a frog now the whole idea behind  this is this bookends  into the old walt simonsen throgs story  where you end up learning that when this  guy showed up that he was basically  puddle gold now  the thing that marvel doesn't tell us  here marvel doesn't tell us how we go  from this alternate reality depiction of  this character  to this current depiction as it's shown  here he's simply just there and the  reality is  we can go with it no one cares i guess  continuity  aficionados of people who are huge on  continuity will be like well actually i  need a definitive explanation but  honestly things like this are easier if  you just accept it if you just go with  it but he ended up just basically taking  time and  you know living in the sewers of of new  york until ultimately he ended up coming  across  thor who had been transformed into a  frog by loki  now the idea is that puddle gulp working  alongside thor  trying to fight against the kingdom of  the rats and so on and so forth  basically demonstrated his worthiness  right the fact that he was  a capable warrior even if he didn't  necessarily have the ability to overcome  the rats t